### 4. Seamless File Transfers

  #### From Kali to Termux:

    # Push any file or directory directly to Termux
    home
    scp -P 8022 -r my_file.txt termux:~/

    # Or using rsync
    rsync -avz -e "ssh -p 8022" my_folder/
    termux:~/my_folder/

  #### From Termux to Kali:

    send-to-kali scan_results.txt ~/projects/
